            "explanation": "The updated regex on line 46 removes some node types like ExportDefaultDeclaration and ExportNamedDeclaration from the SINGLE_CHILD_ALLOWED pattern. This change alters behavior, causing the rule to stop skipping statements that are direct children of these export declarations, which is likely unintended.",
            "suggestion": "Restore the original regex: /^(?:(?:DoWhile|For|ForIn|ForOf|If|Labeled|While)Statement|Export(?:Default|Named)Declaration)$/ on line 46 to correctly match allowed single child nodes."
